    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44382" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐλίμεν-ος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιμήν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with good
				harbours</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκταί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1463
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλις] εὐλιμενωτέρα</span>”
